 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Running<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Longo<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00 \u2022 600 m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Running<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Curto<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:15 \u2022 400 m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o:<\/strong> 11.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:15 \u2022 100 m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de partida dos Trilhos da Cividade 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, com in\u00edcio no Largo de Santana, na freguesia de Bagunte, concelho de Vila do Conde.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios das provas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Longo (18 km) arranca \u00e0s 09:00, enquanto o Trail Curto (12 km) e a Caminhada (8 km) partem ambos \u00e0s 09:15.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es t\u00eam o custo de 15,00 \u20ac no Trail Longo de 18 km, 11,00 \u20ac no Trail Curto de 12 km e 10,00 \u20ac na Caminhada de 8 km at\u00e9 ao encerramento a 18 de outubro.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O kit inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica comemorativa, medalha de finisher, dorsal oficial, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos no percurso e cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio nas provas de trail?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio que cada atleta transporte telem\u00f3vel operacional e copo reutiliz\u00e1vel ou equivalente, dado que a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o disponibiliza copos nos postos de abastecimento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trilhos da Cividade 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-25\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Largo de Santana, Bagunte, Vila do Conde\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila do Conde\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Comiss\u00e3o Trilhos da Cividade e Junta de Freguesia de Bagunte\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de partida dos Trilhos da Cividade 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, com in\u00edcio no Largo de Santana, na freguesia de Bagunte, concelho de Vila do Conde.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios das provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail Longo (18 km) arranca \u00e0s 09:00, enquanto o Trail Curto (12 km) e a Caminhada (8 km) partem ambos \u00e0s 09:15.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es t\u00eam o custo de 15,00 \u20ac no Trail Longo de 18 km, 11,00 \u20ac no Trail Curto de 12 km e 10,00 \u20ac na Caminhada de 8 km at\u00e9 ao encerramento a 18 de outubro.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o kit de participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O kit inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica comemorativa, medalha de finisher, dorsal oficial, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos no percurso e cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio nas provas de trail?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio que cada atleta transporte telem\u00f3vel operacional e copo reutiliz\u00e1vel ou equivalente, dado que a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o disponibiliza copos nos postos de abastecimento.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68611,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-53190","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-vila-do-conde-porto","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_typ